B65 BASIC for the MEGA65 is an ALTERED VERSION of BBC BASIC (Z80) v5 by
R.T. Russell (https://github.com/rtrussell/BBCZ80, commit
1e932b5ad88e13edda54c785d0ce26ff6fa42089). It has been re-implemented in
45GS02 assembly language; keyword, error and indentation tables are
generated from the upstream MAIN.Z80. It is not the original software.

